A [BOS](https://github.com/bos-agent/bos-ai) agent project (archetype: `${archetype}`).

## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `${config_path}` | Project configuration: agents, plugins, runtime, channels. |
| `agents/` | Agent definitions (`.md` frontmatter + system prompt, or `.toml`). Auto-discovered. |
| `extensions/` | Project-local extensions (`@ep_tool`, `@ep_channel`, …). Auto-discovered. |
| `skills/` | Reusable instruction packs the agent can load on demand. |
| `.env` | Secrets (API keys, tokens). Gitignored — never commit it. |

## Run

```bash
boscli gateway start   # start the agent runtime
boscli tui             # attach the terminal UI
```

First prompt to try:

> ${first_prompt}

## Grow the project

```bash
boscli project add agent <name>       # add a specialist agent
boscli project add tool <Name>        # add a custom tool stub
boscli project add channel telegram   # wire a Telegram bot
boscli project doctor                 # check config, paths, env, credentials
```
